                "loc": "MRK.14.32+MRK.14.33+MRK.14.34+MRK.14.35+MRK.14.36+MRK.14.37+MRK.14.38+MRK.14.39+MRK.14.40+MRK.14.41+MRK.14.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mako 14:32-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.39+LUK.22.40+LUK.22.41+LUK.22.42+LUK.22.43+LUK.22.44+LUK.22.45+LUK.22.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Yesu acili pano calo, alepepa no kupapata Lesa mukukuuta ne filambapo, ico ewali na maka yakumupususha ku mfwa. Ico ali uwaicefya no kupetamina Lesa, Lesa alyumfwile amapepo yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nangu ali ni Mwana Lesa, asambilile ukunakila Lesa ku macushi alecula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo asukile aba uwapwililika, ayalwike intulo ye pusukilo lya pe na pe kuli bonse abamunakila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa nao epakumusonta ukuba Shimapepo mukalamba, muli bushimapepo bwakwa Melikisedeki!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali uyu mulandu tulipo ne fyakulanda ifingi, lelo cintu icayafya ukumulondolwela, pantu mwalikosa imitwe, tamumfwa bwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kol 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwena pa nshita ino nimwe mufwile ukuba bakafundisha, lelo ukufika na nomba mucili mulekabila uwakumufunda ifyakutampilakofye ukwishiba pa mashiwi yakwa Lesa. Mu nshita yakulalya icakulya icikosele, imwe mpaka na nomba mucili muleonka ibele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu uucili aleonka ibele, ninshi acili akanya, talati eshibe ukusala ifili bwino ne fishili bwino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalya icakulya icakosa bakalamba, pantu bena mukubomfya ifi fintu, basuka baishiba ukusobolola ifisuma ne fibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
